<body>

    <h1>STANDARD OPERATING PROCEDURE (SOP)</h1>
    <div style="font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 14px;">
        PENGGUNAAN SISTEM MANAJEMEN INVENTARIS, MULTI-GUDANG, &amp; PESANAN (SIMANIS)
    </div>

    <div class="header-meta">
        <table>
            <tr>
                <td style="width: 20%;"><strong>Nama Perusahaan</strong></td>
                <td style="width: 30%;">: PT SIMANIS Multi Niaga Indonesia</td>
                <td style="width: 20%;"><strong>Nomor Dokumen</strong></td>
                <td style="width: 30%;">: SOP-SMN-2026-001</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Departemen</strong></td>
                <td>: Logistik, Sales, &amp; TI</td>
                <td><strong>Versi / Status</strong></td>
                <td>: 2.4 / Berlaku Efektif</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Tanggal Rilis</strong></td>
                <td>: 04 Oktober 2026</td>
                <td><strong>Zona Waktu Sistem</strong></td>
                <td>: Asia/Jakarta (WIB - UTC+7)</td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </div>

    <h2>1. TUJUAN &amp; RUANG LINGKUP</h2>
    <p>
        Dokumen Standard Operating Procedure (SOP) ini dirancang sebagai panduan baku operasional end-to-end seluruh pengguna sistem SIMANIS (Sistem Manajemen Inventaris). Sistem ini menerapkan arsitektur 4-lapisan (Controller, Service, Model, Repository) dan basis data transaksional ACID yang mengintegrasikan pengadaan barang masuk, penyimpanan multi-lokasi, penjualan B2B, pemenuhan fisik pesanan, hingga pencatatan audit trail (Stock Ledger).
    </p>

    <h2>2. MATRIKS PEMISAHAN WEWENANG (SEGREGATION OF DUTIES - SOD)</h2>
    <p>
        Untuk menjaga integritas data keuangan dan mencegah manipulasi fisik barang, sistem mengunci hak akses pengguna secara ketat sesuai peran:
    </p>

    <table class="data-table">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Modul / Fitur Aplikasi</th>
                <th style="text-align:center;">Admin System</th>
                <th style="text-align:center;">Sales Staff</th>
                <th style="text-align:center;">Staff Gudang</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Manajemen Pengguna (User CRUD &amp; Hak Akses)</strong></td>
                <td style="text-align:center;"><span class="badge badge-green">Penuh</span></td>
                <td style="text-align:center;"><span class="badge badge-red">Dilarang</span></td>
                <td style="text-align:center;"><span class="badge badge-red">Dilarang</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Master Data (Produk, Kategori, Gudang, Supplier)</strong></td>
                <td style="text-align:center;"><span class="badge badge-green">Penuh</span></td>
                <td style="text-align:center;"><span class="badge badge-blue">Lihat Katalog</span></td>
                <td style="text-align:center;"><span class="badge badge-blue">Lihat Stok</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Pembuatan Sales Order (SO)</strong></td>
                <td style="text-align:center;"><span class="badge badge-green">Bisa</span></td>
                <td style="text-align:center;"><span class="badge badge-green">Wewenang Utama</span></td>
                <td style="text-align:center;"><span class="badge badge-red">Dilarang</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Persetujuan Sales Order (Approve / Reject)</strong></td>
                <td style="text-align:center;"><span class="badge badge-green">Wewenang Utama</span></td>
                <td style="text-align:center;"><span class="badge badge-red">Dilarang (SOD)</span></td>
                <td style="text-align:center;"><span class="badge badge-red">Dilarang</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Pengeluaran Barang Fisik (Goods Issue - GI)</strong></td>
                <td style="text-align:center;"><span class="badge badge-green">Bisa</span></td>
                <td style="text-align:center;"><span class="badge badge-red">Dilarang</span></td>
                <td style="text-align:center;"><span class="badge badge-green">Wewenang Utama</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Usulan &amp; Pembuatan Purchase Order (PO)</strong></td>
                <td style="text-align:center;"><span class="badge badge-green">Bisa</span></td>
                <td style="text-align:center;"><span class="badge badge-red">Dilarang</span></td>
                <td style="text-align:center;"><span class="badge badge-green">Wewenang Utama</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Pencatatan Barang Masuk (Goods Receipt - GR)</strong></td>
                <td style="text-align:center;"><span class="badge badge-green">Bisa</span></td>
